In the afternoon, the boat stopped at a small island.
I got off there.
I saw a small restaurant near the water.
There were not many people there.
It was a very quiet place.
I went and sat there.
The restaurant owner came near me.
He asked me, "What do you want to eat?"
I asked for rice and fried fish.
He quickly brought and gave me the food.
That food was very simple.
Even so, it had good taste.
While eating the food, I looked at the backwaters.
Small boats were going through the water.
I saw a person rowing his own boat.
Another person was sitting in his friend's boat.
I sat looking at those sights for a long time.
